Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.81,0:00:44.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（警察局证物保管处）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.26,0:01:20.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（案件编号：22408 | 状态：未结案）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.96,0:01:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.08,0:01:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我马上就到了 别忘记了带钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm on my way, and don't forget my money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.84,0:01:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会见 贝利 难道你忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you soon. And, Bailey, don't you forget…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.76,0:02:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.32,0:02:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好奇会害死猫的哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curiosity killed the cat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.76,0:02:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,死你妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.66,0:02:16.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（献给贝利）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.60,0:02:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.32,0:03:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,真酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.64,0:04:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你好啊 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hello, dolly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.01,0:04:35.37,Title,0,0,0,0,,《鬼娃回魂4：鬼娃新娘》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.59,0:05:02.88,Note,0,0,0,0,,（疯狂杀手蕾于芝加哥玩具店被射杀）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.60,0:05:09.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（杀人狂终于毙命）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.47,0:05:15.46,Note,0,0,0,0,,（疯狂杀手遭遇枪杀）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.61,0:05:22.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（男孩宣称娃娃被杀手的灵魂附身）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.80,0:06:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我是金凯德警探 杰德的叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. I'm Chief Kincaid, Jade's uncle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.28,0:06:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫·柯林斯 幸会 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}David Collins. Nice to meet you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.20,0:06:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来吧 大卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}David, come on in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.20,0:06:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰德 大卫来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jade, David's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.04,0:06:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 杰德一直对你赞不绝口 大卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I've been hearing good things about you, David.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.16,0:06:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还知道你明年秋天要去普林斯顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand you're off to Princeton next fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.20,0:06:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.32,0:06:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,主修什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you going to study?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.68,0:06:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,戏剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theater Arts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.56,0:07:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 还拿过运动奖学金 对不？是曲棍球么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm-hmm. But on an athletic scholarship, right? Playing hockey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.24,0:07:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,花样滑冰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figure skating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.88,0:07:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm-hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.76,0:07:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jade!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.56,0:07:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃伦 别大喊大叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warren, don't scream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.56,0:07:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来好美\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.72,0:07:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰德 我必须叮嘱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jade, I have to tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.36,0:07:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙比你上一任优秀多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy is a big improvement over the last one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.88,0:07:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你父母一定会支持你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think your mother and father would have agreed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.00,0:07:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友他们都喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents liked all my friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.92,0:07:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,午夜之前回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be home by midnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.32,0:07:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会照顾她的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's in good hands, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.12,0:07:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.56,0:07:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是忘了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You forget something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.88,0:07:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.68,0:07:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是送你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.88,0:07:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢百合花\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love lilies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.12,0:07:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 这是一种兰花 春草兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, it's an orchid. Cymbidium orchid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.28,0:07:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,花瓶里放点水和阿司匹林\N{\fnArial\fs30}You put it in a vase and drop an aspirin in the water, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.56,0:07:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就能在花瓶里开上一整个星期\N{\fnArial\fs30}it should last you the whole week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.88,0:08:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,从书上看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh so I read.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.44,0:08:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸会幸会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice meeting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.24,0:08:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她刚出门\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.68,0:08:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.36,0:08:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就这么骗过沃伦了？- 嗯嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So Warren fell for it? - Mmm-hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.64,0:08:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫让他印象深刻 我想他是爱上了大卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}David made quite an impression. I think Warren's in love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.72,0:08:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉倒吧 不是我的菜 我可对制服诱惑没感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yuck. Not my type.I'm so over that whole uniform thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.32,0:08:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在不会回家 妈妈你别开玩笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}* I won't go home now, mama Don't make a fool of me *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.64,0:08:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听 我在唱着布基伍基的歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}* You see, I am the boogie-woogie *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.28,0:08:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,要命了 是尼德莱诺斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ. It's Needlenose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.24,0:09:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到了哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.77,0:09:47.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（傻瓜巫术大全）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.60,0:10:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.72,0:10:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我祈求你 赐予我力量吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the power, I beg of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.48,0:10:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.12,0:10:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我祈求你 赐予我力量吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the power, I beg of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.68,0:10:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏醒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.64,0:10:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏醒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.76,0:10:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏醒吧 苏醒吧 苏醒吧 苏醒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awake! Awake! Awake! Awake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.88,0:10:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么破书\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a crock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.80,0:11:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 蒂凡尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Tiffany.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.44,0:11:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.68,0:11:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 让我进去 我都快冻死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let me in. I'll catch my death out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.40,0:11:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来吧 进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promises, promises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.08,0:11:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇喔 唔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Whoo…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.12,0:11:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 今天过的咋样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, how was your day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.96,0:11:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,老样子 老样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same old, same old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.00,0:11:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 看看这个 - 啥玩意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, check it out. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.16,0:11:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.36,0:11:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么玩意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.60,0:11:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该说 这是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, Who is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.12,0:11:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.28,0:11:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,确切说 那曾经是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, Who was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.40,0:11:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.40,0:11:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天啊 你在他身上可真是煞费苦心啊 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. You really did a number on him, didn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.48,0:11:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时用的什么？当时真的这么血腥么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you use? Was it really bloody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.96,0:11:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当时尖叫了么？惨不惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he scream a lot? Was he half…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.52,0:11:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道么 达米安 这家伙看起来真他妈的面熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Damien, this guy looks awfully familiar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.00,0:11:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能认出他的指甲油\N{\fnArial\fs30}I recognize the nail polish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.52,0:11:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.60,0:11:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本就没有杀人 对不对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never really actually Killed anybody, did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.00,0:11:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是？是不是？你这个可怜虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you? Did you? You pathetic worm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.20,0:12:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 蒂凡尼 我正在努力呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Tiff. I'm working up to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.64,0:12:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 得了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.48,0:12:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 弄这个东西我花了十个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it took me 10 hours to make that thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.68,0:12:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,达米安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.72,0:12:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能帮帮忙 帮我看看口红是不是掉沙发底下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you do me a favor, and see if my lipstick is under the sofa there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.44,0:12:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈 啊哈 啊哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, ah, ah, ah, ah…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.24,0:12:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要起来 往前爬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back on your knees. Crawl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.52,0:12:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,真听话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.68,0:12:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样呆在地板上面别起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down on the floor where you belong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.60,0:12:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.80,0:13:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下面什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing under here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.08,0:13:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlotte.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.92,0:13:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么跑出来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.24,0:13:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.72,0:13:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.16,0:13:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂凡尼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiffany?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.92,0:13:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 现在就我俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.32,0:13:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我俩拍拖多长时间了 啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have we been going out for now, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.76,0:14:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.76,0:14:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你不认为你让我等太久了么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think you've kept me waiting long enough?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.08,0:14:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.68,0:14:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.92,0:14:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道法国人怎么形容高潮么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what the French call an orgasm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.92,0:14:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,濒临死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}The little death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.96,0:14:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 蒂凡尼 让我们来体验濒死的快感吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Tiffany. Let's die a little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.20,0:14:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.32,0:14:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我是恰吉 想玩玩么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. I'm Chucky. Wanna play?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.64,0:14:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这玩意儿他妈的从哪弄来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell did you get this thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.12,0:14:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,从条子手里整来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got him from the cops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.80,0:14:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个真实的杀人娃娃 我把它缝好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the actual doll from those murders. I stitched him together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.48,0:14:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我开玩笑呢吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.96,0:14:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我没开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not kidding you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.16,0:14:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我为什么要开玩笑？- 得了吧 蒂凡尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why would I kid you? - Come on, Tiffany.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.56,0:14:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道你很迷信 - 我不迷信\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I knew you were obsessed.- I'm not…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.52,0:14:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是这个恰吉？他太过时了吧？- 不它没过时\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But Chucky? He's so '80s. - No, he's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.92,0:15:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它一点都不吓人 - 不 它很吓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He isn't even scary. - Yes, he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.20,0:15:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他 你看什么呢 哥们？让你盯着我看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at him. What are you looking at, punk? You looking at me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.84,0:15:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那么 算我错了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. So, I was wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.60,0:15:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一开始以为它是个很有意思的娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought he'd make an interesting toy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.04,0:15:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 达米安？- 啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damien? - Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.76,0:15:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,想玩玩么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna play?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.24,0:15:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.52,0:15:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先呢 先拷起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, I do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.68,0:15:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好玩「三人行」了么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready for a ménage a trois?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.20,0:15:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是啥啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.48,0:15:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你懂法语呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you understood French.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.08,0:15:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.16,0:15:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you watch me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.12,0:15:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩都瞧好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.80,0:16:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道么 达米安 关于恰吉我还有些事没和你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Damien, there's something I never told you about Chucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.40,0:16:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉我这个娃娃是个会尿裤子的蠢蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me Schmucky is one of those dolls who wets his pants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.36,0:16:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈 啊哈 啊哈 假如我是你 我就不会那样说恰吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, ah, ah, ah, ah… I wouldn't talk that way about Chucky if I were you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的脾气 很火爆哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a very bad temper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.88,0:16:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.00,0:16:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我们同居好多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, we lived together for years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.48,0:16:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 那是在条子杀死他之前的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, that was before the cops killed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.88,0:16:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他被乱枪打死 附身变成娃娃之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was before he passed his soul into that doll there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.92,0:16:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 他曾经非常的爱吃醋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, was he ever jealous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.36,0:16:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要有人看我一眼 恰吉就会去修理他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody even looked at me, Chucky would take care of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.88,0:16:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会吧 恰吉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't you, Chucky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.28,0:16:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当时都要结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were gonna get married.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.32,0:16:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 当时他真是个完美性伴侣\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, was he an incredible lover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.24,0:16:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是操过我的男人中最棒的一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was the best I ever had.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.56,0:16:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.88,0:16:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就他那个小鸡鸡能满足你这样的悍妇？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ain't big enough to take care of a woman like you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.00,0:17:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋 鸡巴的尺寸不重要 重要的是怎么个干法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't the size that counts, asshole. It's what you do with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.96,0:17:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.76,0:17:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.00,0:17:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.36,0:17:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉咋样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you been?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.64,0:17:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.04,0:17:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你呢？- 好得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You? - Peachy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.24,0:17:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 和你说实话吧 我都有点手生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, to tell you the truth, I've been kind of out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.56,0:17:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂的 我找你找了十年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. It took me 10 years to find you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.04,0:18:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,真恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.72,0:18:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,和这种垃圾选手混有啥前途？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing with this jerk anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.08,0:18:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,十年是一段很长的时间 恰吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten years is a long time, Chucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.92,0:18:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 我从没和他上过床 你知道我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, I was never actually with him.You know me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.48,0:18:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀人不眨眼 但是我只和心爱的人上床\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill anybody, but I'll only sleep with someone I love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.56,0:18:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看着好美 蒂凡尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look great, Tiff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.20,0:18:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.24,0:18:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是认真的 实话实说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it. I gotta be honest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.60,0:18:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总认为你会就此而放纵自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always thought you were gonna let yourself go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.64,0:18:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.84,0:18:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.92,0:18:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.88,0:18:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,别摸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.04,0:18:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯.\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.12,0:18:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,满意了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you satisfied?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.96,0:19:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请问我能上车里等着吗？- 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I wait in the car, please? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.72,0:19:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 小痞子 该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Boogie Nights, you're up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.88,0:19:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是他妈的胡搞\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is such a load of shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.08,0:19:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们没喝过酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know we haven't been drinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.80,0:19:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你们现在就没什么好担心的了 是不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then you've got nothing to worry about, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.72,0:19:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evening, Chief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.52,0:19:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来是虚惊一场吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems like a false alarm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.96,0:19:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 诺顿 安全第一 对不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay, Norton.Better safe than sorry, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.72,0:19:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你越来越过分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a new low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.80,0:19:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.96,0:19:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 滚进车里 - 你管我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get in the car. - Bite me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.24,0:19:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰德 等你到十八了 你就算下地狱我也不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jade, when you're 18, you can go to hell, for all I care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.16,0:19:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是在那之前 我要盯紧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But until then, I'm stuck with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.60,0:19:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果你和这人渣让我难堪 我就会让你好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll be damned if I'm gonna let you embarrass me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.80,0:19:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和这人渣到此为止了\N{\fnArial\fs30}by ending up on Jerry Springerwith some trailer trash lowlife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.08,0:19:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,操你妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.44,0:19:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你操不成\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.76,0:19:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,远离杰德 永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not Jade anyway.Not anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.24,0:19:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.56,0:19:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能阻止我们见面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't keep us from seeing each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.08,0:19:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是警长 我可以为所欲为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the Chief of Police, sport. I can do whatever I want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.76,0:20:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢 例如 我今晚就可以给你验血\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if, for example, I was to run a blood test on you tonight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.12,0:20:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那结果就会让你好看 显示你嗑药了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the results made you look like{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.40,0:20:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,人在江湖 身不由己啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christian Slater on New Year's Eve, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.32,0:20:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为有人会质疑我么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}you think anybody would question me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.40,0:20:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 唬谁呢？- 走着瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's bluffing? - Try me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.80,0:20:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望我们能白头偕老\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish we really could choose our own families.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.52,0:20:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫 你的小兰花现在枯萎了 听懂了么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}David, you keep your orchid dry now, you hear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.48,0:20:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, sunshine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.28,0:20:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,「走着瞧」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Try me"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.32,0:20:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.84,0:20:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,换做是我 我就会带杰德私奔 远走高飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I were you, I would take Jade, get the hell out of Dodge, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.36,0:20:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and never look back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.16,0:20:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 恰吉 我做的瑞士肉丸 你的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Chucky.I made Swedish meatballs, your favorite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.28,0:20:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你太费心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, you shouldn't have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.20,0:20:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 我希望今晚的一切都会很完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I wanted everything tonight to be absolutely perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.60,0:20:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂凡尼 那他妈的是啥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiff, what the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.80,0:21:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝宝护栏 给婴儿用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a playpen, silly, for the nursery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.32,0:21:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 恰吉 戒指我还带着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Chucky, I still have the ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.04,0:21:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么戒指？- 就那个 你留给我的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What ring? - The ring, the one you left for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.72,0:21:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死的那天 我在壁炉里找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found it on the mantel the night you were killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.36,0:21:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都没摘下过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never taken it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.12,0:21:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 那个啊？我从维维安·范佩尔特身上弄的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that? The one I got from Vivian Van Pelt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.84,0:21:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是维维安？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vivian who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.04,0:21:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,维维安·范佩尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vivian Van Pelt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.36,0:21:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被我弃尸入河了 想起来了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dumped her in the river, remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.04,0:21:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这戒指能值个五六千吧 至少\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ring is worth five or six grand, easy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.12,0:21:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 你当时没打算向我求婚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, you weren't gonna ask me to marry you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.72,0:21:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的刚才 说啥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you…fucking nuts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.88,0:21:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.12,0:21:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一点都没变\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.44,0:21:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后也不会变\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.84,0:21:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我他妈的当时到底在想些啥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was I thinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.04,0:21:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 先把我从这娃娃身体里弄出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the first thing we gotta do is get me out of this body{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.28,0:21:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远的出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}once and for all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.08,0:21:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.20,0:22:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我更喜欢你现在的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I prefer you like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.72,0:22:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点小可爱 就好像一个小宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kind of cute. You're just like a little baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.00,0:22:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,小宝宝痒不痒啊？痒不痒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the little baby ticklish? Is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.44,0:22:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.24,0:22:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,痒不痒啊？痒不痒啊？痒不痒啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he? Is he? Is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.36,0:22:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹 别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.88,0:22:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,痒不痒啊？痒不痒啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he? Is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.28,0:22:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 妈咪累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Mommy's tired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.32,0:22:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,该睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to go to sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.60,0:22:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我想通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.64,0:22:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在还纠结着关于结婚成家的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still hung up on the domestic thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.64,0:22:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 我们会搭上末班车的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem. We'll get hitched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.68,0:22:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我对小个子不来电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I'm not into short guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.12,0:22:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈总说爱会让人自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother always said love was supposed to set you free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.52,0:22:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其实不是那样 恰吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's not true, Chucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.24,0:22:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直被你的爱禁锢着 禁锢了好久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been a prisoner of my love for you for a very long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.84,0:23:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是还债的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's payback time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.80,0:23:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let me out of here right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.32,0:23:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,做个好梦 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet dreams, asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.80,0:23:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我痴狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}* I'm crazy *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.72,0:23:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,痴狂于这惆怅的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}* Crazy for feelin' so blue *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.32,0:23:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,早已明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}* I knew *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.68,0:23:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你说爱我天长地久\N{\fnArial\fs30}* You'd love me as long as you wanted *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.96,0:23:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是某一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}* And someday *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.52,0:23:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是会离我而去另寻新欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}* You'd leave me for somebody new *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.96,0:24:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,为相思而痴狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}* Crazy for tryin'*{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.16,0:24:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,为哭泣而痴狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}* And crazy for cryin' *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.32,0:24:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还依然痴狂的爱着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}* And I'm crazy for lovin' you *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.52,0:24:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为相思而痴狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}* I'm crazy for tryin'*{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.92,0:24:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,为哭泣而痴狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}* And crazy for cryin' *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.16,0:24:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰西 亲爱的 能帮个忙么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesse, honey, could you give me a hand with this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.80,0:24:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 好的 等一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay, just a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.24,0:24:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 小心肝 欠你一次哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, sweetface. I owe you one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.68,0:24:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.24,0:24:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.80,0:24:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.28,0:24:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来 你要搬出来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you moving out already?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.36,0:24:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没那么走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}No such luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.36,0:24:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.40,0:24:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,想让我把它放进那辆车里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to put that in the car?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.76,0:25:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我只是 你知道的 拿去捐点东西行行善么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm just, you know, taking some stuff to the Goodwill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.68,0:25:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好重啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's heavy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.80,0:25:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.92,0:25:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面装的啥啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.12,0:25:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你知道的 装点这 装点那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you know. A little of this, a little of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.64,0:25:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些快过时的东西 全是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuff that's gone out of style. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.76,0:25:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也看见过捐赠品\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever look at something, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.84,0:25:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道有些东西看到会恶心到死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you realize you are just sick to death looking at it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.72,0:25:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对这箱子就有这种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how I feel about that shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.80,0:25:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,放这 扔车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. In the trunk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.12,0:25:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,扔车里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the trunk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.36,0:25:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.52,0:25:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,膝盖弯一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bend your knees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.12,0:25:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇喔 你太强了 肌肉不错 经常锻炼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. You are strong. Nice muscle tone. You work out a lot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.64,0:25:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,经常做俯卧撑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been doing some push-ups.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.96,0:25:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.04,0:25:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.12,0:25:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,也死不了 还能帮点忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't hurt it. Might help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.32,0:25:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂凡尼 你丫死哪去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiffany, where the fuck are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.72,0:25:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got some company?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.44,0:25:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 带孩子呢 小屁孩嘴不干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, just babysitting. Foul-mouthed little fucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.88,0:25:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你绑上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me help you with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.48,0:26:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你等会干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are you doing later on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.16,0:26:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I was thinking{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.20,0:26:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我俩「出去喝一杯」什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe you and I could go get a drink or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.76,0:26:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是 如果你想去的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is, if you're up to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.12,0:26:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.08,0:26:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,为嘛啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.24,0:26:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有女朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm seeing someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.48,0:26:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.44,0:26:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好男人都死光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the good guys are taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.72,0:26:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.08,0:26:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.08,0:26:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.96,0:26:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.52,0:26:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好待她 杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Treat her right, Jesse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.16,0:26:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.48,0:26:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,要好好待她 千万别逢场作戏 虚情假意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Treat her right. Never take her for granted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.12,0:26:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像我妈妈也总这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like my mother always used to say, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.60,0:26:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,「女人整天为男人在灶前忙碌」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"A woman spends all day slaving over a hot stove for a man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.36,0:26:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,「男人至少也得为女人洗个碗嘛」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"the least he can do is the dishes"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.68,0:26:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈也算是半个哲学家了 至少\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's kind of a philosopher, my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.68,0:26:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.04,0:26:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.36,0:26:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.60,0:27:02.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（慢慢整死蒂凡尼）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.72,0:27:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,拼写：女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spell "woman."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.56,0:27:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,B-I-T-C-H.BITCH.（婊子 贱人）\N{\fnArial\fs30}B-I-T-C-H.BITCH.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.08,0:27:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,错误 女人的正确拼法是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is incorrect. The correct spelling of "woman" is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.20,0:27:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,W-O-M-A-N\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-O-M-A-N.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.40,0:27:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你还会些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shows how much you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.28,0:27:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,呦吼 我回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yoo-hoo! I'm home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.28,0:27:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 啧 啧 啧 啧 啧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Tsk, tsk, tsk, tsk…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.24,0:27:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不好好玩 我可就把玩具都收走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can't play nice, I may just have to take your toys away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.72,0:27:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个惊喜给你哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a surprise for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.68,0:27:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在考虑你说的关于结婚的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been thinking about what you said about wanting to get married.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.56,0:27:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？- 我认为最好还是先把你安定下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - I think it would do you good to settle down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.52,0:27:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 这样很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babe, this is great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.80,0:27:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢肯定 你不会后悔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't regret it, I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.76,0:27:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会像公主一样的对待你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna treat you like a princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.20,0:27:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是啥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.76,0:27:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的新娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your bride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.00,0:28:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴上戒指 我俩结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}With this ring, I thee wed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.68,0:28:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 恰吉 她很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Chucky.She's beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.00,0:28:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你丫死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are so dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.44,0:28:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜恭喜 恰吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations, Chucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.80,0:28:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我想你们两个小孩子想亲热一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm sure you two kids would want to be alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.56,0:28:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于警员鲍勃·贝利的凶手线索仍然毫无头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}While there are still no leads in the murder of Officer Bob Bailey, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.84,0:28:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是种种迹象表明\N{\fnArial\fs30}evidence suggests that his death maybe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.56,0:28:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,与今日发现的另一起命案有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}linked to another body found earlier today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.20,0:28:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,原名为霍华德·菲茨沃特的达米安·贝洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damien Baylock, whose real name was Howard Fitzwater, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.12,0:28:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,于今日下午发现被弃尸东河\N{\fnArial\fs30}was dragged from the East River this afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.60,0:28:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,普雷斯顿警探 你认为两起凶杀案有关系么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detective Preston, is there a connection between these two murders?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.64,0:28:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能 我们正在侦破中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be. Possibly. We're looking into it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.68,0:28:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是连环杀手所为么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this the work of a serial killer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.64,0:29:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许吧 - 我可没这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe. - I didn't say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.52,0:29:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官 你没这么说 但是你可以给我们分析下罪犯的心理\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir, you didn 't, but what can you tell us about these murders?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.32,0:29:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,分析个屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.40,0:29:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以告诉你这里曾经是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can tell you that this used to be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.04,0:29:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个很漂亮 安宁的乡下农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}a nice, quiet, rural community.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.12,0:29:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还活着 活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's alive! Alive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.20,0:29:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰肯斯坦的新娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bride of Frankenstein.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.84,0:29:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我誓爱到底 永守贞洁 至死方休\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise to love, honor and cherish till death do us part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.60,0:29:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的真对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got that right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.12,0:30:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她厌烦于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She hate me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.80,0:30:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们非死不可\N{\fnArial\fs30}We belong dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.48,0:31:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.52,0:31:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我祈求你 赐予我力量吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the power, I beg of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.20,0:31:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.80,0:31:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏醒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.16,0:31:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏醒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.16,0:31:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么破咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a crock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.12,0:32:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去你妈的 你对我做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch! What have you done to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.28,0:32:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你如愿以偿了 你现在是我的了 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got your wish. You're mine now, doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.72,0:32:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你知道这有多好么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you know what's good for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.40,0:32:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将会去相爱 并永守贞洁\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are going to love, honor and obey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.12,0:32:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会嫁给你这个小玩偶娃娃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't marry you if you had the body of G.l. Joe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.76,0:32:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 土娃娃 也不去照照镜子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Raggedy Ann, you looked in the mirror lately?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.96,0:32:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在根本就不是你抱怨的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now is not the time to get picky. Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.96,0:32:54.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（傻瓜巫术大全）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.88,0:33:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对吧 蒂凡尼 没有我帮你 你会一直这个样子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Face it, Tiff. You need me. Otherwise, you're stuck like this for good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.68,0:33:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用你管 我自己查咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need you. I'll look it up myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.04,0:33:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 查吧 第六章\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, go ahead. Chapter six.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.96,0:33:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,217页\N{\fnArial\fs30}Page 217.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.04,0:33:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛阿神之心 什么玩意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Heart of Damballa. What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.80,0:33:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个护身符\N{\fnArial\fs30}An amulet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.60,0:33:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了它 才能向人类身体中移魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need it to transfer our souls into human bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.00,0:33:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 哪能找到呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. And where the hell is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.08,0:33:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些混蛋向我开枪的那晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wearing it around my neck{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.36,0:33:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就把它带在我的脖子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}the night those bastards gunned me down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.12,0:33:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,它现在和我的尸体一起埋在 新泽西洲 哈肯萨克市\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was buried with my corpse in Hackensack, New Jersey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.56,0:33:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们出发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.08,0:33:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 当然 我控制方向盘你来踩油门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sure. I'll steer and you can work the pedals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.60,0:33:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是娃娃啊 你个白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're dolls, you dope!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.16,0:33:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊 那我们怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! What are we gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.56,0:33:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.36,0:33:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.44,0:33:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白 为啥不邮寄娃娃呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it. Why don't you just mail the dolls?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.56,0:33:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些娃娃很特别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These dolls are very special.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.40,0:33:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么「特别」的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "special"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.96,0:34:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 如果明天你送到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, there's$500 in it for you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.72,0:34:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就有500元报酬\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you get them there by tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.00,0:34:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别问太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}No questions asked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.36,0:34:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本可以自己做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd do it myself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.12,0:34:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我得照顾我的一个智障小屁孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I have to take care of a friend who's mentally incapacitated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.12,0:34:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.32,0:34:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'll do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.60,0:34:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我要一千元\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I want$1, 000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.40,0:34:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 小心肝 我会先预付一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, sweetface, I can give you half now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.04,0:34:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我新泽西的朋友会给你另一半的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my friend in Jersey will give you the rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.84,0:34:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙就在垫子下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keys are under the mat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.80,0:34:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我画上你的浓妆吧 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}* Color me your color, baby *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.12,0:34:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我画上你的浓妆吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}* Color me your color *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.48,0:34:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我画上你的浓妆吧 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}* Color me your color, darlin'*{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.88,0:34:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我深知你心\N{\fnArial\fs30}* I know who you are *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.20,0:34:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,卸掉你那浓浓的伪装\N{\fnArial\fs30}* Come up off your color chart *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.52,0:34:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你来自哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}* I know where you're coming from *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.52,0:34:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,约我吧 约我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}* Call me Call me *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.16,0:34:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直都在线\N{\fnArial\fs30}* On the line *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.56,0:34:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,约我吧 随时随地都约我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}* Call me, call me any, anytime *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.32,0:34:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,约我吧 约我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}* Call me Call me *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.88,0:35:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 无论白昼黑夜都可以随时约我\N{\fnArial\fs30}* My love, you can call me any day or night *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.08,0:35:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,约我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}* Call me *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.96,0:35:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.56,0:35:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,小芭比 别兴奋过头了哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barbie, eat your heart out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.60,0:35:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… Urn…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.20,0:35:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,表现自然点 好不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just act natural.Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.72,0:35:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,约我吧 约我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}* Call me Call me *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.44,0:35:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 约我吧 随时随地都约我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}* My love, Call me, call me any, anytime *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.40,0:35:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,约我吧 约我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}* Call me Call me *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.04,0:35:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 约我吧 约我\N{\fnArial\fs30}* My love, call me, call me…*{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.08,0:35:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,「请把娃娃交给新泽西洲 哈肯萨克市」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Please deliver dolls to Caretaker's office, Forest Creek Cemetery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.40,0:36:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,「林溪公墓的守门人 致谢 蒂凡尼」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hackensack New Jersey.Love and kisses, Tiffany"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.40,0:36:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,公墓？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cemetery?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.60,0:36:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你的诡辩多理而约我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}* Call me for your lover's lover's alibi *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.60,0:36:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,约我吧 约我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}* Call me Call me *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.24,0:36:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直都在线\N{\fnArial\fs30}* On the line *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.72,0:36:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,约我吧 随时随地都约我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}* Call me, call me any, anytime *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.00,0:36:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫 你还记得布拉德·巴克么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}David, you remember when you were seeing Brad Barker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.80,0:36:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 必须记得 唔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Vividly. Whoo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.72,0:36:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还很爱他 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You loved him, didn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.28,0:36:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 很爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.80,0:36:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.96,0:36:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他老妈发现了一封我写给他的信\N{\fnArial\fs30}His mother found a letter I'd written him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.20,0:36:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后暴走了 从那之后就没联系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She freaked, and we haven't spoken since.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.16,0:36:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看吧 杰德\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Jade, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.64,0:36:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,春宵一刻值千金啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}we get very few chances in life to be happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.16,0:36:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要把握好你现在的机遇啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta grab the brass ring when you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.80,0:37:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,真他妈的磨蹭\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have time for this shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.80,0:37:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰德 我有话要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jade, I need to talk to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.92,0:37:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Jesse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.32,0:37:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 大卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, David.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.00,0:37:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持联络啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want details.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.24,0:37:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰西 沃伦随时都会回来 如果他逮到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesse, Warren will be home any second. If he catches you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.32,0:37:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰德 你知道我永远都不会对你虚情假意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jade, you know I'll never take you for granted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.80,0:37:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰西 - 你懂的 就像如果你做饭 我会洗碗一样 对不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jesse… - You know, like if you'd cook, I'd do the dishes, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.24,0:37:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.44,0:37:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意为你付出一切 一切的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd do anything for you, anything at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.28,0:37:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 对不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.40,0:37:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.12,0:37:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是的 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.80,0:37:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那嫁给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then marry me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.64,0:37:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 嫁给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Marry me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.16,0:37:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就今晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.00,0:37:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃伦会宰了我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warren would kill us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.16,0:37:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎沃伦怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care about Warren.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.36,0:37:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们要私奔的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we're gonna disappear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.48,0:37:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we gonna go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.84,0:37:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想去哪就去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anywhere you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.32,0:37:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那钱怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what are we gonna do for money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.84,0:37:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.28,0:37:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么搞到的钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.32,0:37:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得我那个邻居 蒂凡尼么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know my neighbor, Tiffany?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.80,0:37:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她付了我500元 托我送一对娃娃给她新泽西的一个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's paying me$500 to take a couple of dolls to a friend of hers in Jersey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.56,0:37:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰德 送到之后还会再收到500元的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jade, there's another $500 when we get there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.20,0:38:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 妈的 杰西 那骚货想干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit, Jesse. What has that freak gotten you into?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.08,0:38:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 也不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I don't care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.88,0:38:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以贷款买套房子 找份工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can put a deposit on an apartment. I'll get a job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.00,0:38:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后供你上大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll help put you through college.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.36,0:38:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我快吐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm gonna throw up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.48,0:38:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰德 嫁给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jade, marry me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.16,0:38:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.84,0:38:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 「我愿意」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say, "I do"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.32,0:38:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那走吧 去收拾东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's get you packed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.88,0:38:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.72,0:38:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哦 真浪漫啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, that's so romantic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.48,0:38:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,顶多半年 或者三个月 若她变胖的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give them six months, three if she gains weight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.36,0:38:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.68,0:39:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的车正好停在我家门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}His van is parked right in front of my house as we speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.04,0:39:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙是谁？想干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell is this bozo? What's he doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.84,0:39:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,捣乱我们行程的 还能干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screwing with our ride, that's what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.28,0:39:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈 管他呢 我要运动运动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, what the hell.I need the exercise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.04,0:39:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那刀是长在你手上的么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you born with that Knife super-glued onto your hand, or what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.16,0:39:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.48,0:39:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝保佑 恰吉 新潮一点好不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God's sake, Chucky, drag yourself into the '90s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.80,0:39:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想什么邦德和电锯杀人狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stabbings went out with Bundy and Dahmer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.88,0:39:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就像玛莎·斯图尔特拿着菜刀是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like Martha Stewart with that thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.44,0:39:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是他妈的玛莎·斯图尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the fuck is Martha Stewart?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.96,0:39:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的偶像\N{\fnArial\fs30}My idol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.80,0:39:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,当家里来宾客你又恰好没时间购物时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what does Martha tell you to do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.76,0:39:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莎就会告诉你怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}when guests drop by for dinner and you haven't had time to shop{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.28,0:39:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,发挥你的创意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You improvise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.48,0:39:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.96,0:40:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,显而易见了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Predictable…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.96,0:40:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.48,0:40:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.24,0:40:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.36,0:40:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在那了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.16,0:41:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.36,0:41:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.72,0:41:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么看起来这么面熟呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does that look so familiar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.36,0:41:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吗？现在 这真是天才的杰作\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? Now, that's the work of a true homicidal genius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.72,0:41:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不赖嘛 对于一个业余选手来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad, for an amateur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.12,0:41:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 他们回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. Here they come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.36,0:41:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.84,0:41:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.24,0:41:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.60,0:41:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莎·斯图尔特会怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would Martha Stewart do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.68,0:41:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.44,0:42:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 帮忙啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.52,0:42:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,正帮忙呢 太重了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am helping. He's heavy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.44,0:42:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.12,0:42:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.20,0:42:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.80,0:42:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会粗心不锁车门吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've sworn that door was locked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.12,0:42:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快吧 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.08,0:42:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.48,0:43:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还击吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}* Give it back *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.92,0:43:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}* My, my *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.16,0:43:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.52,0:43:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好空虚\N{\fnArial\fs30}* I'm empty *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.48,0:43:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,又很悲伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}* And sad *{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.36,0:43:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,又他妈的干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.32,0:43:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚怎么样 孩子们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you kids doing tonight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.84,0:43:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,要去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going somewhere?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.04,0:43:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你俩都下车 好不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you both get out of the van now, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.12,0:43:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺顿警员 我有个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officer Norton, I have a question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.44,0:43:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么跟踪我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this following us around…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.88,0:43:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的正常职务所在呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that covered by your regular salary?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.40,0:43:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是我叔叔付钱指使你的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or does my uncle pay you extra?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.72,0:44:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.48,0:44:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我相信你也不是坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sure you're not a bad person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.96,0:44:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道你是在履行职责而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that you're just doing your job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.76,0:44:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是请你放过我们行不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But couldn't you just please give us a break?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.52,0:44:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道 我也希望这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I wish I could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.16,0:44:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看起来也是好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem like really nice kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.80,0:44:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你们 也没什么成见\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing personal, at least on my part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.72,0:44:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 是为了钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… The money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.48,0:44:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真够恶心的 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're disgusting.Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.28,0:44:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的闭嘴 不然我发誓 我会宰了你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, or I swear to God, I'll fucking vaporize you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.60,0:44:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.40,0:44:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动 放松点 放松 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Take it easy. Take it easy. Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.04,0:44:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊 这样的话我们哪也去不成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. We're never gonna get away with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.36,0:44:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会放过我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're never gonna let us go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.28,0:44:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.64,0:44:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.92,0:44:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你去路边买点吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, why don't you go get us something to eat for the road, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.72,0:44:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我来搞定这个尼德莱诺斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll deal with Needlenose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.96,0:45:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好不？- 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right? - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.64,0:45:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.24,0:45:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.92,0:46:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 真他妈的胡搞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's bulishit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.68,0:46:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这不是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know this isn't mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.52,0:46:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你摊上大事了 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in a lot of trouble, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.04,0:46:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他妈的老实呆着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now don't you fucking move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.72,0:46:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.96,0:46:34.03,Title,0,0,0,0,,这他妈的简直就是《绝命追杀令》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figures you'd hitch us a ride with the fugitive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.92,0:46:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,打火机给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your lighter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.64,0:46:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.96,0:46:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,发挥创意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Improvising.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.16,0:46:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 好好坐着 和大师学着点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, sit back and learn from the master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.88,0:46:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,金凯德警长没有回复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief Kincaid isn't answering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.16,0:46:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思？「没有回复」 我就是想和他谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "He's not answering?" I just talked to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.24,0:47:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屁烂娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rude fucking doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.24,0:47:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰德 快回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Jade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.52,0:47:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺顿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Norton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.28,0:47:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you still there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.92,0:47:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺顿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Norton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.24,0:47:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.24,0:48:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesse!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.64,0:48:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰西 杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesse! Jesse!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.32,0:48:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车 快上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in! Get in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.08,0:48:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在那 快报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}There they are.Call the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.20,0:48:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 妈的 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. Shit. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.36,0:48:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰西 开车 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesse, drive! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.24,0:48:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.76,0:48:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 至少你还没有忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least you haven't forgotten{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.76,0:48:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么去讨好一个姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}how to show a girl a good time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.88,0:49:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才去哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.04,0:49:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,憋了半天就这句话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that all you have to say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.36,0:49:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你想要我说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want me to say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.52,0:49:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你有话要说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should think you'd have something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.88,0:49:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,说说刚才那是咋回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}to say about what happened back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.16,0:49:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要说 你真他妈的疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got something to say. I think you're fucking crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.28,0:49:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我疯了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm crazy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.60,0:49:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你所说的：「你会付出一切？」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say you'd do anything for me, and this is what I get?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.88,0:49:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你感觉刚才那是我干的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. You don't think that I had anything to do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.20,0:49:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 刚才那场爆炸 - 不是么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- with that explosion back there? - Didn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.88,0:49:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.40,0:49:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 我还觉得你有嫌疑呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be honest, I was thinking the same thing about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.20,0:49:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能那样想？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you think that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.28,0:49:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当着一群人面前说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You announced in front of a hundred people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.40,0:49:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要宰了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you wanted to vaporize him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.76,0:49:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 那只是说说而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it was a figure of speech.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.00,0:49:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你刚才也是这么怀疑我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you were just as quick to accuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.20,0:49:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 怎么个屄事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. What the fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.16,0:49:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫 我也不知道该怎么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}David, I don't know what to tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.64,0:49:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道这周围到底他妈的怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what the hell is going on around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.40,0:49:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 警方认为作案手法干净利落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the cops seem to think it's all pretty cut and dried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.76,0:49:58.99,Title,0,0,0,0,,想想什么《闪灵杀手》《鸳鸯大盗》吧 想起来了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of Mickey and Mallory, Bonnie and Clyde. You get the picture?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.08,0:50:01.15,Title,0,0,0,0,,或是《闪灵杀手》《鸳鸯大盗》？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mickey and Mallory? Bonnie and Clyde?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.24,0:50:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是疯狂杀手 大卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were mass murderers, David.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.88,0:50:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,多重杀手 确切说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Multiple murderers, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.52,0:50:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一次杀很多人 就像电影里「邮局」的那段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mass murders happen all at once, Like at the post office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.96,0:50:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像现在正火的「连环杀手」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Multiple murders are serial killings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.32,0:50:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不太懂 不是只死了诺顿一个吗 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I missing something? Norton was just one murder, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.88,0:50:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察在诺顿的车旁发现一个打火机\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found a cigarette lighter next to Norton's car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.28,0:50:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个被割喉的贝利警员的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Belonged to that cop who got his throat slashed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.64,0:50:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后还有另一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's another thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.60,0:50:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰德 你叔叔失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jade, your uncle's missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.36,0:50:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.44,0:50:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我知道这事与你俩无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know you two had nothing to do with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.80,0:50:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是或许你俩应该在他们破案之前先去自首\N{\fnArial\fs30}But maybe you should turn yourselves in until they figure it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.52,0:50:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫 你疯了嘛？谁会相信我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}David, are you whacked? Nobody is gonna believe us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.52,0:50:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会在洲界设路卡检查的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're setting up roadblocks at the border.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.00,0:50:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩最好躲一躲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two had better lay low for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.76,0:50:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.28,0:50:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚看到沃伦了么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see Warren tonight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.32,0:50:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上之后就没见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not since this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.00,0:50:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你呢？- 也没\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.31,0:51:13.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（尼加拉瀑布）
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.08,0:51:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们七号大街的小屋正逐渐变冷 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Our little room on Seventh street is getting cold ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.16,0:51:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 某天我在毛毯上看到了一圈图案 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I saw a pattern on a blanket just the other day ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.44,0:51:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 看起来就像你扔掉的枕头 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It looked just like the pillow you threw away ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.20,0:51:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 嗯 哼 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Uh-huh ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.68,0:51:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 某天夜里我突然醒来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I just woke up the other night ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.48,0:51:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 现在我知道该做什么 我猜是看你去下地狱 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And now I know what to do I guess I'll see you in hell ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.84,0:51:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 对吧 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Yeah ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.32,0:51:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.28,0:51:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信我吗 杰德？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you trust me, Jade?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.44,0:51:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.84,0:52:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,白痴啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.04,0:52:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他们真的很般配\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they make a cute couple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.56,0:52:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否认为 就此拆散他们真的是太可惜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you ask me, it'd be a shame to break 'em up, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.48,0:52:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你明白我的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you know what I mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.36,0:52:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬爱的主啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dearly beloved, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.00,0:52:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今夜齐聚于此\N{\fnArial\fs30}we are gathered here tonight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.24,0:52:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,见证这对新人的结合\N{\fnArial\fs30}to celebrate the union of two people in holy matrimony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.48,0:52:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,在主的庇佑之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what God joins together, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.72,0:52:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们永不分离\N{\fnArial\fs30}let no man tear asunder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.00,0:52:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,电影与电视里的暴力镜头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Violence in movies and television…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.04,0:52:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这他妈什么屄玩意儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this shit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.40,0:52:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.08,0:52:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 我死之后音乐越来越烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, the music scene's gone to hell since I've been dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.88,0:52:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才像点样儿么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's more like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.84,0:53:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么美好啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it beautiful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.64,0:53:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直梦想着能在教堂里办一场盛大的婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always dreamed of having a big church wedding{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.56,0:53:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有伴娘 蛋糕 还有报纸上的宣传照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}with bridesmaids and a cake and my picture in the paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.56,0:53:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅仅是普通的狗仔照 是漂亮的婚纱照\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just the usual mug shot, but something really flattering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.84,0:53:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂凡尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.36,0:53:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.00,0:53:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}For everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.68,0:53:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 我想我不能这么小气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Urn, I guess I can't corn plain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.80,0:53:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我总想着让我们多多在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rnean, I always wanted us to spend rnore tirne together, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.40,0:53:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起旅行啊 看看世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe do some traveling and see the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.08,0:53:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而 现在看看我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, just look at us now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.52,0:53:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 人生总是充满着惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Life sure is full of surprises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.08,0:54:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,拦住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.16,0:54:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,宰了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.60,0:54:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论顺利挫折\N{\fnArial\fs30}For better or worse, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.32,0:54:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论贫贱富贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}for richer or poorer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.40,0:54:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论健康病痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}in sickness and in health, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.00,0:54:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱的至死不渝\N{\fnArial\fs30}till death do you part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.12,0:54:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜 你可以吻你的新娘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations. You may now kiss the bride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.20,0:54:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.60,0:54:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,经典永远都是经典啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A true classic never goes out of style.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.64,0:54:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.60,0:54:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰德和杰西是连环杀手的事实是真的么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true that Jesse and Jade may in fact be the serial killers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.20,0:54:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就你最近几日的侦查来看？\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you've been tracking for the past few days?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.00,0:55:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have some…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.20,0:55:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我们无法证实\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't confirm that at this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.60,0:55:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,前几宗命案似乎出自一人之手\N{\fnArial\fs30}The previous murders appear to be the work of just one killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.28,0:55:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 可能是他们的一个人质\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's possible, actually, it's possible that one of them is a hostage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.76,0:55:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是根本就毫不知情\N{\fnArial\fs30}or simply unaware of what the other is up to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.36,0:55:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,警探？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detective?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.00,0:55:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就目前来看 根据现有的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the time being, in the absence of any other information, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.00,0:55:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这俩孩子可能是持有枪械 并且非常危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}these kids have to be considered armed and extremely dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.36,0:55:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 明天上午我们去送娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}First thing tomorrow morning, we deliver the dolls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.92,0:55:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后收钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We collect our money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.68,0:55:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.60,0:55:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.08,0:55:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 门 呃 门是开着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. The, uh, door was open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.72,0:55:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才不知道屋里有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't realize there was anybody in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.08,0:55:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉斯 我想我们刚才订了套「总统套」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Russ! I thought we were getting a suite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.88,0:55:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.44,0:55:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这谁啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.64,0:55:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们刚才订了套「总统套」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we were getting a suite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.12,0:55:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这是我们的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. This is our room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.32,0:55:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.20,0:55:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.96,0:55:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Russ!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.76,0:56:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊 你这一辈子看过这么可爱的东西么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. Have you ever seen anything so cute in your whole life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.00,0:56:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好棒的结婚礼物啊 她太美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a great idea for a wedding gift. She's beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.96,0:56:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.16,0:56:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 这个小家伙 长了一张只有他妈才喜欢的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this little guy has a face only a mother could love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.80,0:56:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我是恰吉 换做我 就会闭嘴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. I'm Chucky, and I wouldn't talk if I were you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.96,0:56:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿-嘚-吼\N{\fnArial\fs30}H i-de-ho.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.28,0:56:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰吉 我想起来了 那个好哥们娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky! Of course. I remember.He was a Good Guy doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.92,0:56:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说会说各种脏话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were programmed to say all kinds of shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.92,0:56:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.12,0:56:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 我真不喜欢它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't like him at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.92,0:56:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 你们真是郎才女貌的一对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you two really make a delicious-looking couple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.96,0:56:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 戴安 你认为呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Diane, don't you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.80,0:56:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, absolutely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.28,0:56:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 想想他们孩子会是什么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, imagine what their children are gonna look like, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.60,0:56:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 天有点晚了 然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, it's getting late, and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.36,0:56:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你们今晚要干嘛？嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are you guys up to tonight? Hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.00,0:56:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的新婚之夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our wedding night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.84,0:56:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 那你们还看毛电视啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, so what are you watching TV for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.76,0:56:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 你看 我们也是新婚之夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you see, it's our wedding night as well, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.76,0:56:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样多完美啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is what makes this just so perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.16,0:57:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道别人怎么说么？「人越多 越热闹」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what they say?"The more, the merrier."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.32,0:57:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, yeah. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.84,0:57:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？我们很累了 想早点睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? We're really tired. Gotta get to bed early.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.36,0:57:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 我们就在隔壁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, we'll be right next door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.72,0:57:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.96,0:57:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小偷贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thieving slut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.76,0:57:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不配带那颗戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't deserve to wear that ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.68,0:57:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬我门\N{\fnArial\fs30}To us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.88,0:57:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 拉斯 让我歇会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Russ, give me a break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.08,0:57:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正儿八经的在度蜜月 记得不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are, technically, on our honeymoon, remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.36,0:57:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 好吧 是你要来这的 不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, it was your idea to come here, not mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.36,0:57:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你说过我们在度假中心捞的要更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you we'd have seen more action at Club Med.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.40,0:57:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 既然来了 就好好干吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we're here. Let's make the best of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.36,0:58:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.48,0:58:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样 宝贝 来吗 对 来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, baby, come on. Yeah. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.52,0:58:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.48,0:59:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱死你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.64,0:59:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很早之前就该这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have asked you this a long time ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.00,0:59:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂凡尼 愿意做我的新娘么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiffany, will you be my bride?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.44,0:59:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 恰吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Chucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.56,0:59:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿意 愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.64,0:59:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.44,1:00:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.48,1:00:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.92,1:00:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哭什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you crying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.04,1:00:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在婚礼上都会哭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always cry at weddings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.76,1:00:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊 我还会哭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.I'm crying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.20,1:00:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道 其他器官还管用不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder if all the plumbing works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.56,1:00:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我不知道你怎么样 但是我已经在升国旗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't know about you, but I'm starting to feel like Pinocchio here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.92,1:00:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.24,1:00:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的构造完全没问题 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am anatomically correct, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.56,1:00:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.32,1:01:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.76,1:01:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？干嘛？什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.08,1:01:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有乳胶（套套）吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you got a rubber?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.12,1:01:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有乳胶（套套）吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have I got a rubber?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.52,1:01:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.60,1:01:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的 - 干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tiff! - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.08,1:01:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我 我浑身都是乳胶（套套）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me. I'm all rubber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.56,1:01:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好吧 等等 我还以为你是塑胶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's right. Wait.I thought you were plastic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.52,1:01:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的 - 干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tiff! - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.08,1:01:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吻我 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kiss me. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.76,1:02:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？大卫 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? David, it's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.40,1:02:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jade!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.12,1:02:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们在哪？- 尼加拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you? - Niagara.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.16,1:02:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,汽车蜜月旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Honeymoon Sweets motel, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.52,1:02:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 相信我这比听起来还要糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}which, believe me, is even worse than it sounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.96,1:02:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.16,1:02:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好 我结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm married.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.92,1:02:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还不好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that bad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.48,1:02:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的好害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.88,1:02:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 可能是他干的 大卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think, maybe he did it, David.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.56,1:02:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想杰西可能已经彻底的迷失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Jesse has totally lost it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.20,1:02:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.04,1:02:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What should I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.12,1:02:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.32,1:02:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.48,1:02:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你必须去警局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you've got to go to the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.00,1:02:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.00,1:02:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还爱着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still love him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.76,1:02:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么问题么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.00,1:02:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,等会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.68,1:02:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？大卫 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? David, it's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.16,1:02:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Jesse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.12,1:02:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉这么晚给你打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to call you so late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.16,1:02:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有麻烦了 是杰德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a problem. It's Jade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.04,1:02:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 去警局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. Go to the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.20,1:02:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 在没人受伤之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, before somebody else gets hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.56,1:02:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,呦 吼 有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yoo-hoo! Anybody here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.36,1:03:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,房间打扫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Housekeeping!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.04,1:03:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？房间打扫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Housekeeping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.88,1:03:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这玩的开心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joy to be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.12,1:03:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 哦 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Oh, my…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.80,1:03:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,果然新婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Newlyweds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.40,1:03:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们玩的都啥花样啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the heck went on here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.48,1:03:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.68,1:03:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.40,1:03:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能和你一起走 杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't go with you, Jesse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.20,1:03:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,分手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.60,1:04:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你能先说出来可真是解脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man, I'm glad you said that first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.20,1:04:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.80,1:04:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰德 我受不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jade, this is too much for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.48,1:04:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 我会一直爱着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you. I will always love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.60,1:04:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我的忍耐是有限度的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there is a limit to how much I can take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.40,1:04:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能别在说「我是个疯子」之类的话了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you please stop talking to me like I'm the one who's crazy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.36,1:04:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才是疯子呢 你才是疯狂杀手呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the crazy one! You're the mass murderer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.28,1:04:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说多重杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean multiple murderer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.76,1:04:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你算是承认了？- 不 我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So you admit it? - No, I don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.76,1:04:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真他妈忍不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't take this shit anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.80,1:04:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 既然你们两个立场都那么坚定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, the thing that struck me was how sure you both sounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.80,1:04:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 只有三个可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to me, that meant one of three things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.68,1:04:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,一是有人说谎 二是你们脑子让驴踢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of you is lying, both of you are whacko, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.48,1:04:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,三是你们都错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or both of you are wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.20,1:04:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我比任何人都了解你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Add to that the fact that I know you both better than anybody else, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.28,1:04:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩就连一只苍蝇都不忍伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I've never seen either of you so much as hurt a fly, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.08,1:04:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后结论就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I've concluded that what we have here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.32,1:04:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个天大的误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a terrible misunderstanding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.64,1:04:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们闻到什么怪味没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you guys smell something in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.96,1:04:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你们吵架的原因是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, for the sake of argument, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.72,1:05:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你干的 也不是我干的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it wasn't you, and it wasn't me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.32,1:05:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么谁会去想杀掉沃伦和尼德莱诺斯呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}then who else would want to kill Warren and Needlenose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.80,1:05:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那对夫妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}And those people from last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.40,1:05:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脑袋进水了？沃伦死了吗？他只是失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're assuming Warren's dead.He's only missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.32,1:05:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在说沃伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're suggesting that Warren…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.76,1:05:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 为什么不能？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.88,1:05:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打赌他比你们还要神经质\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd buy him as a psychopath before either of you two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.72,1:05:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,噗 啥玩意这么臭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pooh! Something really stinks in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.32,1:05:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你别在这里乱扔袜子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you not to leave your dirty socks back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.16,1:05:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 这可不是袜子味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, this ain't no dirty socks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.00,1:05:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我真是个大白痴 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I feel like such an idiot.- Me, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.44,1:05:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我竟然会相信你会去杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I can't believe I actually thought that you could kill someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.88,1:05:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.04,1:05:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫 我们真的不能离开你\N{\fnArial\fs30}David, what would we do without you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.96,1:05:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思 「离开我」\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "Without me?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.80,1:06:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说你让我们都清醒了 我们欠你一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean you set us straight.We owe you one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.96,1:06:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个好哥们 最好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good friend. The best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.24,1:06:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车 马上停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull over! Pull over now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.04,1:06:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫 怎么了 哥们 有话好好说\N{\fnArial\fs30}David, come on, buddy, it's me. Come on, let's talk this over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.88,1:06:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不是你哥们 - 我操 大卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not your buddy. - Fuck, David!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.36,1:06:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please put the gun down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.84,1:06:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,为嘛？那样你们就能把我也杀了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? So you can kill me too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.56,1:06:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没杀过人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't kill anybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.36,1:06:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你们真行 真行啊 差点骗过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're good. You're good! You even had me fooled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.60,1:06:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说啥呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.56,1:06:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.24,1:06:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.96,1:06:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫 不是我做的 是她做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}David, I didn't do it. She did it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.76,1:06:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would never…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.08,1:06:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.72,1:06:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 救命 这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, help! Over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.84,1:06:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 统统不许动 - 哦 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nobody move! - Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.40,1:06:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.76,1:06:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样也行？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That works too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.48,1:07:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的把车开起来 快 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get this heap of shit moving! Now! Now! Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.37,1:07:34.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（您现在已经到达 新泽西洲 花园之洲）
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.16,1:07:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想关于这点你俩一定满脑子问号吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I imagine at this point you two must have a lot of questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.96,1:07:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们是谁吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do know who I am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.76,1:07:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰吉 还有这是蒂凡尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chucky. And this is Tiffany.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.52,1:07:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以前见过 对吧 心肝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe we've already met, haven't we, sweetface?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.56,1:07:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你们怎么变成的娃娃？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how did you end up like this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.80,1:08:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个 说来话长啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's a long story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.76,1:08:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sure is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.08,1:08:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 如果拍成电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, if it was a movie, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.72,1:08:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少能拍个三四集\N{\fnArial\fs30}it would take three or four sequels just to do it justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.16,1:08:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要拿我们怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do with us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.64,1:08:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,问的真有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny you should ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.24,1:08:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,娃娃身体还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}These bodies are okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.84,1:08:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们就像租来的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they're like apartments that we're just renting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.56,1:08:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在我们要改变现状\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now we're movin' on up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.68,1:08:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,找个好地段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like George and Weezie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.32,1:08:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,买一套房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're looking to buy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.12,1:08:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,当人们说起房产 总是说到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what they say about real estate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.52,1:08:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,地段 地段 地段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Location, location, location.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.72,1:08:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们几个家伙 来的正好 但是来的不巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you guys are definitely in the right place at the wrong time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.88,1:08:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急特殊报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a WEBH special report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.60,1:08:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰西和杰德的案件变得越来越诡异\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Jesse and Jade case keeps getting weirder and weirder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.12,1:08:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在两个凶案现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fin gerprints discovered at two separate crime scenes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.68,1:08:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,都采集到了查尔斯·李·雷的指纹\N{\fnArial\fs30}have been identified as belonging to Charles Lee Ray, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.16,1:08:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,在1988年于玩具店被击毙的连环杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}the notorious serial killer gunned down in 1988.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.52,1:08:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方计划今日前往新泽西洲 哈肯萨克市林溪公墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now police confirm that Ray's corpse will be exhumed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.68,1:08:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,掘出查尔斯·李·雷的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}from a Hackensack, New Jersey cemetery sometime today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.80,1:09:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 恰吉 洛阿神之心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Chucky, the Heart of Damballa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.32,1:09:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 该怎么办？该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know! - WhaVII we do? WhaVII we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.88,1:09:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 让我想想 行不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up! Just let me think, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.24,1:09:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先得先换辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}First we gotta get some new wheels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.84,1:09:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,半径500米内的条子都能发现这辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every cop within 500 miles is looking for this van.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.56,1:09:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要一辆不显眼 但是很拉风的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need something inconspicuous, but with a little style.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.58,1:09:31.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（向东46公里 欢迎光临哈肯萨克）
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.08,1:09:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住 宝贝 免得又刺到你的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold still, honey, or I'm gonna poke you in the eye again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.36,1:09:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我相信我一定会迷死人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I believe I'm going to look absolutely ravishing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.88,1:09:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.72,1:10:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的瑞士肉丸天下第一 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody makes Swedish meatballs like you, babe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.64,1:10:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 超赞 - 谢谢 大宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Peachy! - Thanks, honey pot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.12,1:10:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能留着点肚子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you left room for dessert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.72,1:10:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的 小宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it, pooky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.12,1:10:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 早知道结婚这么快活的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if I had known that marriage was such a great gig, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.32,1:10:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不会拖了这么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would never have waited this long to tie the knot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.16,1:10:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,从某方面来讲 她不太会收拾屋子 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the other hand, she's not much of a housekeeper, is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.68,1:10:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蒂凡尼？- 啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tiff? - Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.44,1:10:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些盘子他们不会自己洗好的 知道吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those dishes aren't gonna wash themselves, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.64,1:11:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给做饭就很不错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were nice enough to cook for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.52,1:11:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好歹也洗个碗吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The least he could do is wash the dish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.36,1:11:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.72,1:11:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.60,1:11:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莎·斯图尔特会怎么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would Martha Stewart say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.04,1:11:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他妈的玛莎·斯图尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck Martha Stewart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.56,1:11:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莎·斯图尔特只配来亲我的塑胶屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martha Stewart can kiss my shiny plastic butt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.44,1:11:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我他妈的在灶前忙来忙去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here I am slaving away over a hot stove, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.84,1:11:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,做饼干 做瑞士肉丸 都为了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}making cookies, making Swedish meatballs, and for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.76,1:11:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了一个不会欣赏我的臭男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a man who doesn't appreciate me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.48,1:11:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了一个连盘子都不洗的臭男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a man who can't even wash one fucking dish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.84,1:11:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了一个连男人都算不上的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a man who isn't even a man at all where it counts, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.72,1:11:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你明白我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you get my drift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.68,1:11:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it from me, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.20,1:11:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,塑胶是无法取代木棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plastic is no substitute for a nice hunk of wood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.88,1:11:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天晚上她可没这么抱怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't hear her complaining last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.84,1:11:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些需要木棒的家伙 确切说是电动跳蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any guy would need a hunk of plastic, probably battery-operated, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.68,1:11:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,来达到自己的高潮\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get a reaction out of you in bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.48,1:12:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by the way, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.52,1:12:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的从哪学的这种烤这种屎饼干？\N{\fnArial\fs30}where the hell did you learn to bake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.32,1:12:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你竟敢这么对我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you speak to me that way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.04,1:12:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你起的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}You started it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.16,1:12:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.88,1:12:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.92,1:12:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.72,1:12:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰西？杰西？醒醒 求你了 哦 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesse? Jesse, please.Please. Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.44,1:12:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.00,1:13:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.56,1:13:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.16,1:13:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jade!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.48,1:13:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.52,1:13:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快 快 快走 - 不能扔下你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go, go, go! - Not without you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.04,1:13:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我随后就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right behind you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.04,1:13:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.12,1:14:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.92,1:14:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jade!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.56,1:14:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.00,1:14:48.24,Note,0,0,0,0,,（林溪公墓）
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.36,1:15:08.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（查尔斯·李·雷之墓 卒于1988年）
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.36,1:15:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down there. Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.44,1:15:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开棺材 杰德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the coffin, Jade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.60,1:15:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 很快了 你这个混蛋小魔星\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hurry up.- I'm trying, you fucking midget!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.68,1:15:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 真是惨不忍睹啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh! You really didn't need to see that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.20,1:16:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,把护身符给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the amulet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.48,1:16:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.36,1:16:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,贱人 你弄断了我的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch! You broke my neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.16,1:16:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.44,1:16:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,先放了杰德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let Jade go first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.72,1:16:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.76,1:16:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰德？待会见\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Jade? See you real soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.28,1:16:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.52,1:17:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好男人难道都死光了么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't I ever get it on with the real good guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.44,1:17:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是幸运的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a lucky girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.12,1:17:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱紧我 恰吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catch me, Chucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.88,1:17:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.72,1:18:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.88,1:18:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.60,1:18:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.84,1:18:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,拔出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.76,1:18:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.80,1:18:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好戏登场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's show time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.88,1:18:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.76,1:18:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我祈求你 赐予我力量吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the power, I beg of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.20,1:19:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.68,1:19:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.56,1:19:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 恰吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Chucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.52,1:19:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.56,1:19:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们属于彼此了 永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}We belong together, forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.68,1:19:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,吻我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiss me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.00,1:19:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.40,1:19:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.72,1:19:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 恰吉 瞧瞧我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Chucky, look at us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.28,1:19:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你不懂么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.44,1:19:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们非死不可\N{\fnArial\fs30}We belong dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.92,1:20:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.64,1:20:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱里在相见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you in hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.80,1:21:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈总是对我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother always told me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.96,1:21:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱会让人自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}love would set me free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.72,1:21:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我刀上滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off my knife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.72,1:21:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手举起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see your hands!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.20,1:21:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下 放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the gun! Drop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.84,1:21:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我上去 让我上去 让我上去 让我上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out! Let me out! Let me out! Let me out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.00,1:21:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.32,1:22:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.24,1:22:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,来开枪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead and shoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.52,1:22:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会复活的 我总是会复活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back.I always come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.72,1:22:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是死亡真他妈的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}But dying is such a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.88,1:22:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事是没人会相信的 你们懂么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's ever gonna believe this.You know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.08,1:22:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们会怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's gonna happen to us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.72,1:22:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,普莱斯顿 是的 我在这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Preston. Yeah, I'm here now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.56,1:22:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕我们的清单上又多了一具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid we've got another corpse to add to the list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.76,1:23:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰西和杰德？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesse and Jade?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.24,1:23:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 不是他们干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, they didn't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.60,1:23:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧把法医喊过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get forensics down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.88,1:23:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们绝不会相信这种操蛋事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're never gonna fucking believe this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.92,1:23:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.60,1:23:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩回家 别乱跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two go on home. And stay put.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.08,1:23:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.24,1:23:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.76,1:23:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.72,1:24:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了个大操 我了个去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn! Son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.48,1:24:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.20,1:24:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,贱人 妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch! Jesus!{\r}
